{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"863631111585660938","content":"I'm aware some of this has been answered, but I feel like it'll be useful to have everything all together - how does the intermission downtime work, regarding the following:\n-resting - even without taking damage/casting spells etc, if there's RPing would we need to note resting or would it just be assumed in this case?\n-crafting/buying things\n-training, such as at the backroom\n\nI know:\n-no searching for essences unless given by DMs\n-channels is mostly just ships/ports\n-V either already has, or is going to when asked, turn off the long rest reminder system for the duration\n\nand also anything else potentially important\n\n(also, when is the level 7? is it at the end of intermission/start of week 4, or the end of week 4, since it looks like there's. one more day after week 4 ends? this is mostly out of curiosity - I haven't run my level 6 yet since I'm still deciding on stuff, but)","created_at":"2021-07-31T15:06:41.030000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-31T15:11:37.478000Z","id":"871046215494672424","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"863631111585660938","content":"End of week 4 of content","created_at":"2021-07-31T15:22:56.991000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"871050308971819079","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"863631111585660938","content":"In general this intermission represents a time jump.  How much time is not clear.  So you won't really be resting, but also won't really be playing.\n\nThe dms will offer some stuff possibly.  This can range from cladding, pvp, hell shows, missed events they really wanted to do, etc.\n\nAlso there will be the continental congress where players will be able to decide on a constitution analog.\n\nI have recommended people back off of RP due to this being some needed downtime for everyone, and roleplay inevitably leads to conflicts, people needing to be there, etc.  But it was decided to leave ships and dock in case people really want to hop in character.\n\nThe dms will also be using this time to do rewrites of events to fit changes in the narrative.  So the more we are here, the less we will be doing that.\n\nI expect almost nothing to happen this weekend... I know all the dms need a few days for rest and family, but I expect more details to be dropped by or on Monday.","created_at":"2021-07-31T15:29:43.780000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"871052015168553010","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
